# Test hints for CSVProcessor
# Requires managed plugin: https://github.com/arolang/plugin-rust-csv
#
# Both modes (GitLab #884 acceptance test).
#
# The compiled binary used to answer `Cannot parsecsv the parsed from the
# csv-data.` while `aro run` worked. The staticlib compiled and linked fine
# all along: `aro-plugin-sdk-rust` advertises the verb (`parsecsv`) in its
# manifest but registers only the Rust function name (`parse_csv`) in its
# dispatch table, so it answered `Unknown action: parsecsv`.
# `NativePluginHost` had retried with snake_case candidates since the SDK
# shipped; `PluginLoader.callCPlugin`, which is the path a statically linked
# plugin takes, had no fallback. Both share `PluginActionDispatch` now.
mode: both
occurrence-check: true
